        "created_at": "2012-08-15T18:55:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It depends on the order of the text.</p><p>If it says \"deal the damage; destroy this card,\" then the buff applies. In fact, I think it HAS to be in that order, or else by a technicality it would no longer be in play, so the damage would never happen.</p>",
